        ],
        "text": "Just spent the 4th at Grayton Beach at “All Decked Out” with my 4 sons, my mom (who was celebrating her birthday), my sister and my brother and his family. We loved waking up and enjoying coffee on the balcony looking at the ocean, days at the beach and pool, and dinners at the Red Bar. House is beautiful - elevator great for older guest - with a perfect location. Highly recommended.",
